# VANTYX – Search Term Triage Engine 🚀

VANTYX is a Python-based tool that analyzes advertising search terms and helps users make better marketing decisions using statistical analysis.

## Features

* Promote high-performing search terms
* Block underperforming search terms
* Ignore terms without clear evidence
* Review terms with insufficient data
* Interactive dashboard and analytics
* Export triage results

## Tech Stack

* Python
* Pandas, NumPy, SciPy
* HTML, CSS, JavaScript

